{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Too Many Expectations", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to  social contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening that will be happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>The Future Perfect tense is used to express an action that will be finished at some point in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I will be studying at the library at 4:00 p.m. tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The person will start studying at some point in the future and be studying at 4:00 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop studying. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at home at 7:00 p.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived </span> home from the office by 6:30 p.m.  <br/>The plane will leave the airport at 9:15 a.m. You will get to the airport at 9:00 a.m. When you arrive, the plane <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for the structure of the Future Continuous and Future Perfect tenses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">not</span>) + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span> + verb <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Very soon you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be delving into</span> a new project that involves making a profit.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">By the time he is found, you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have taken</span> another path.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "People will be following your career and watching you carefully.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You will be combining your ideas with hers. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You will have learned from your past failures and this woman will be mentoring you. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are not decided, or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you discuss things that are planned in the future, you can use the Present Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present when you talk about schedules and timetables.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You will need her when your career moves into the public arena.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You are going to fall in love with two men but the first will disappear mysteriously. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You are moving into the public eye.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The meeting starts at 6:30 tomorrow!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to delve into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look for detailed information about something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will be delving into a new project that involves making a profit. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when talking about jobs. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "endeavor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an attempt to do something that may be new or difficult", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is an endeavor that requires travel and expansion of your career.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "self-assured", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having or showing confidence in yourself and your abilities", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  He's tall and self-assured.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to mentor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to teach and give advice to a less experienced person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This woman will be mentoring you. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be in the public eye", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be under the attention and scrutiny of the public", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You are moving into the public eye.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be behind someone", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to be supporting someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your friends will be behind you and keep you safe from misfortune.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to call upon", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to demand or ask for the presence of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your strength will be called upon during this time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "misfortune", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an unlucky condition or event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will be kept safe from misfortune thanks to your friends.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Get your partner to ask you 4 or 5 questions about various aspect