rts at 6:30 tomorrow!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Fortune Teller</span>: Hmm. Interesting. Very soon you will be delving into a new project that involves making a profit. It is happening slowly at first and then gaining speed. It is an endeavor that requires travel and expansion of your career. You are going to gain a certain degree of fame.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Go on.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Fortune Teller</span>: I see a man. He's tall and self-assured. He will provide you with financial stability, but there will be a price.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh that doesn't ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Fortune Teller</span>: Wait! In the distance there is another influence. You will be combining your ideas with hers. You will have learned from your past failures and this woman will be mentoring you.", "time": "19000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Fortune Teller</span>: You will need her when your career moves into the public arena. You are moving into the public eye. People will be following your career and watching you carefully.  Your friends will be behind you and keep you safe from misfortune. If you don't mind, I would like to tell you something personal. You are going to fall in love with two men but the first will disappear mysteriously. Your strength will be called upon during this time, and by the time he is found, you will have taken another path.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay. I think I've heard enough. Thank you. I have to go.", "time": "63000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}